  "lookup_name": "VFM_02_Operations",
  "description": "Vector & Forces Museum, hall 2 — Operations. Four XL stations on open floor (VectorWorkbench, dot product, cross product, projection/reflection) arranged in two bands, with a single gallery row of plinths for the small force-and-angle interactables. Teleporter at the far end leads to the Motion hall.",
